## Notes for Claude Code

- `AGENTS.md` is the single source of truth for this project. Keep project rules there, not here.
- Before writing Teloce code, open the matching file under `@@DOCS_DIR@@/` (start with `index.md`). Quote the
  syntax from the docs instead of recalling it.
- Work in small steps: change one thing, rebuild, check the page and the console, then continue.
- When a Teloce feature misbehaves, read `@@DOCS_DIR@@/known-issues.md` before changing the framework or
  adding a workaround of your own.
- Ask before adding dependencies, changing `teloce.config.json`, or touching generated files in `dist/`.
